author":"张镃","text":"红蘤墙头蜂过叶，翠藤池面蚁行枝。\n暂来数刻有馀兴，若住此轩何限诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57476,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题挂剑图","author":"张镃","text":"当年许与有谁知，人忽邱陵我独悲。\n逊国曩时犹易耳，不应留剑使心欺。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57477,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题禹庙二首 其二","author":"张镃","text":"为人心切屡忘家，力量方知有等差。\n莫信空山葬冠剑，且吟古屋画龙蛇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57478,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题禹庙二首 其一","author":"张镃","text":"从来大智特闲闲，手足胼胝意不艰。\n千古夏王崇庙祀，浚川功用只随山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57479,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题赵祖文画","author":"张镃","text":"破烟飞鹭不排行，林外青山閟晓光。\n村犬吠人循岸走，见成诗句省思量。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57480,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题圆觉寺跳珠轩","author":"张镃","text":"箨龙来向石根蟠，幻出摩尼跃翠盘。\n今日山中晴亦雨，可无风过发清寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57481,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题扇","author":"张镃","text":"梧竹风来玉枕凉，月高偏爱占华堂。\n休言境界亲曾有，画出如闻夜气香。","collection":"宋","n